                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "key": "alert_number",
                  "description": "(Required) The number that identifies an alert. You can find this at the end of the URL for a code scanning alert within GitHub, and in the `number` field in the response from the `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/code-scanning/alerts` operation."
